id: unlocked-potential-potential
name: Potential
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Hidden within you lies a dormant power that was previously untapped, now brought to the surface.
text: >
  Potential: Hidden within you lies a dormant power that was previously untapped, now brought to the surface.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you have a stack of Power, increase your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by Z(bT).
  (2)-[Passive]: Reduce the penalty from a Botch Result by Z(bT) on Combat Rolls.
  (3)-[Passive]: For each Power Level reached, increase your Maximum Life and Ki Points by Z.
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Category of your Critical Result Extra Die by Z Categories.
  (5)-[Triggered, Z/Round]: After having rolled a Combat Roll, you may choose to increase the Natural Result by 1. This can allow you to score a Critical Result or avoid a Botch Result.
  (6)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: Enter the Surging State until the end of your turn.

---

# (1) With a stack of Power: Combat Rolls and Soak Value Z(bT).
[passive, effect 1]
if (power.stacks >= 1) {
    combatRolls += $Z * 1(bT);
    soakValue += $Z * 1(bT);
}

# (2) A Botch's penalty Z(bT) lower on Combat Rolls: the table's (the penalty is one number for every roll).

# (3) Z Maximum Life and Ki Points a Power Level.
[passive, effect 3]
life.perLevel += $Z;
ki.perLevel += $Z;

# (4) The Critical Result's Extra Die Z Categories higher.
[passive, effect 4]
dice.critical.category += $Z;

# (5) A Combat Roll's Natural Result 1 higher after seeing it, Z times a Round: the table's.

# (6) Using the Power Up, once an Encounter: the Surging State till the end of your turn.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter, effect 6]
enterState(surging, 1, turn);
